Third-party assets

The four files in `stream/` - squaremap.ytd, circlemap.ytd, minimap.ytd and
minimap.gfx - are the community-standard minimap shape masks and cleaned-up
minimap graphics, as distributed with the QBCore qb-hud resource. They are
included so that a square border sits on a square map out of the box. They are
not the work of this project's author and are not covered by the licence above.
Replace them with your own if your distribution needs to.
